   - Generates 5 AI-powered message variations
   - Handles errors gracefully with fallback messages
   - Shows loading state while generating

### __How It Works:__

```javascript
User clicks "Generate with DeepSeek" 
  ↓
Frontend sends request to /api/generate/message
  ↓
API route calls OpenAI GPT-4
  ↓
Returns 5 message variations
  ↓
Displays in suggestions panel
  ↓
User can click to use any suggestion
```

